### 1. Login and capture token into a variable
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    // Automatically saves the "token" field from the JSON response
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Direct bypass
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/1001
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 2. Test protected API using the saved variable ##1 api/products/1001
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1001
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

